  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN-OCHA World Humanitarian Summit, June 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The regional consultation in C&#xf4;te d&#xbf;Ivoire is expected to start at either the 11th or 16th of June 2014, and the time span is two days. Approximately 150 representatives from governments, affected societies, civil societies, regional organisations, and the private sector, NGO&#xbf;s, UN organisations and academics will be invited to the consultation. The Consultation will consist of a plenary gathering and workshops, about relevant issues regarding the four main topics of the summit. Feedback and opinions received from online consultations and social media will also be included to secure as broad a perspective as possible.</narrative>
  </description>
